bilbo reindex: rebuild the catalog and the search index from the store.

[1mUsage:[22m
  [36mbilbo reindex[39m

[2mBoth hold nothing the store does not: reindex makes them again from it.[22m
[2mIt waits for another bilbo that is writing the store.[22m

[1mOutput:[22m
  entries [2m<n>[22m, chunks [2m<n>[22m, unread [2m<n>[22m, failed [2m<n>[22m
  index bytes [2m<n>[22m, milliseconds [2m<n>[22m

[1mExit:[22m
  [1m0[22m  success, also when entries of a kind no reader reads were left out
  [1m1[22m  an entry failed or could not be read back, or a store or index failure
  [1m2[22m  usage or config error

[1mExamples:[22m
  [36mbilbo reindex[39m

[1mDocs:[22m [2mhttps://github.com/delucca/bilbo/wiki/Commands#reindex[22m
